        <p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#8E89A8;max-width:820px;">Self-host stays the default — most teams want to own their own DB credentials. <strong style="color:#D4D0E6;">Backlex Cloud</strong> (managed) runs the same Apache-2.0 codebase on Cloudflare for teams who'd rather not, with one-click export so you can leave any time.</p>
